{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Create a responsive custom Shopify footer section with two main areas:
    
    A large colored footer panel
    A black bottom copyright/payment bar
    
    The upper footer panel should have:
    
    Rounded corners
    Full-width content inside a centered max-width container
    A top navigation row
    Social media icons on the right
    A divider line
    Four footer columns below
    
    Column examples:
    
    Support
    Account
    Quick Link
    Information
    
    Each footer column should allow multiple links or text items.
    
    The Support column should support:
    
    Address
    Email
    Phone
    Optional icons beside each item
    
    The top row should support:
    
    Footer navigation menu
    Social icons such as YouTube, Facebook, Instagram
    
    The bottom black bar should contain:
    
    Copyright text on the left
    Payment method icons on the right
    
    Make this section responsive for desktop, tablet, and mobile.
    
    On desktop:
    
    Show the four footer columns in one row
    Keep copyright left and payment icons right
    
    On mobile:
    
    Stack footer columns vertically
    Keep spacing compact
    Center or left align items based on a Theme Editor setting
    Allow the copyright and payment icons to stack
    
    Make these settings editable from the Shopify Theme Editor:
    
    Main footer background color
    Bottom bar background color
    Text color
    Link color
    Hover color
    Heading color
    Border/divider color
    Border radius
    Section width
    Max content width
    Top/bottom padding
    Column gap
    Font size
    Font family
    Font weight
    Text alignment
    
    Use Shopify menu selectors for navigation and footer link groups.
    
    Use image pickers or SVG/icon options for:
    
    Social media icons
    Support icons
    Payment method icons
    
    Build with Liquid, CSS, and minimal vanilla JavaScript only.
    
    Do not use external libraries.
    
    Keep all styles scoped to this section.
    
    Do not overcomplicate the code., Modify the existing footer section only. Do not create a new footer and do not replace the current section structure.
    
    Match the reference design much more closely.
    
    Main Footer Panel
    
    Change the large upper footer panel to:
    
    Deep red background
    White text
    Rounded corners
    Centered inside the page with left and right margins
    Compact vertical height
    Remove the very light grey background
    
    Add a decorative center notch/cut shape at the top edge of the red panel, similar to an inward trapezoid cut. Keep it responsive.
    
    Make the notch decorative only and do not affect content positioning.
    
    Top Row Inside Red Panel
    
    Add a top row inside the red panel:
    
    Left side:
    
    Horizontal footer navigation menu
    
    Right side:
    
    Social icons
    
    Example navigation:
    
    Home
    About Us
    Shop
    Video
    News
    Contact
    
    Add social icons:
    
    YouTube
    Facebook
    Instagram
    
    Add a thin subtle divider line below this top row.
    
    Make both the menu and social links fully functional.
    
    Add Theme Editor controls for:
    
    Navigation menu selector
    Navigation font family
    Font size
    Font weight
    Text color
    Hover color
    Menu gap
    Social icon size
    Social icon color
    Social icon spacing
    Divider color
    Footer Columns
    
    Keep four columns:
    
    Support
    Account
    Quick Link
    Information
    
    Reduce the excessive vertical empty space.
    
    Align all four columns toward the top.
    
    Make the layout compact like the reference.
    
    The Support column should contain:
    
    Address with location icon
    Email with mail icon
    Phone with phone icon
    
    Account column should support links such as:
    
    My Account
    Login / Register
    Cart
    My Wishlist
    
    Quick Link column should support:
    
    FAQ
    Contact
    Privacy Policy
    Terms Of Use
    
    Information column should support:
    
    Community Guidelines
    Track My Order
    Return Policy
    
    Use Shopify menu selectors for Account, Quick Link and Information wherever possible.
    
    Typography
    
    Make column headings white and slightly larger than links.
    
    Add Theme Editor settings for:
    
    Heading font family
    Heading font size
    Heading font weight
    Heading text transform
    Link font family
    Link font size
    Link font weight
    Link color
    Link hover color
    Line height
    Column gap
    Row gap
    Bottom Black Bar
    
    Keep a separate black bar below the red panel.
    
    Left side:
    
    Copyright text
    
    Right side:
    
    Payment / trust logos
    
    Keep the content aligned to the same maximum width as the red footer panel.
    
    Add Theme Editor controls for:
    
    Bottom bar background color
    Copyright text color
    Copyright font size
    Copyright alignment
    Payment icon height
    Payment icon gap
    
    Allow payment icons to be managed from Theme Editor.
    
    Overall Width and Spacing
    
    Add frontend settings for:
    
    Footer max width
    Side margins
    Red panel padding top
    Red panel padding bottom
    Red panel left/right padding
    Border radius
    Column spacing
    Top navigation row height
    Bottom bar height
    
    Default desktop layout should be visually compact and close to the reference design.
    
    Mobile
    
    On mobile:
    
    Hide or wrap the top navigation neatly
    Keep social icons visible
    Stack footer columns vertically
    Allow accordion mode for Account, Quick Link and Information
    Keep Support visible
    Stack copyright and payment icons if needed
    
    Add separate mobile controls for:
    
    Padding
    Font sizes
    Column spacing
    Icon sizes
    
    Preserve all current functionality and modify the current footer only.
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}

{% style %}
  .ai-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
  }

  .ai-footer-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    max-width: {{ block.settings.footer_max_width }}px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 {{ block.settings.side_margin }}px;
  }

  .ai-footer-main-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: relative;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.main_bg_color }};
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.border_radius }}px;
    padding: {{ block.settings.panel_padding_top }}px {{ block.settings.panel_padding_horizontal }}px {{ block.settings.panel_padding_bottom }}px;
  }

  .ai-footer-main-{{ ai_gen_id }}::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: -{{ block.settings.notch_size }}px;
    left: 50%;
    transform: translateX(-50%);
    width: 0;
    height: 0;
    border-left: {{ block.settings.notch_size }}px solid transparent;
    border-right: {{ block.settings.notch_size }}px solid transparent;
    border-bottom: {{ block.settings.notch_size }}px solid {{ block.settings.main_bg_color }};
  }

  .ai-footer-top-row-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    margin-bottom: {{ block.settings.top_row_bottom_margin }}px;
    gap: 20px;
    min-height: {{ block.settings.top_row_height }}px;
  }

  .ai-footer-nav-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    gap: {{ block.settings.nav_gap }}px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .ai-footer-nav-{{ ai_gen_id }} a {
    color: {{ block.settings.nav_text_color }};
    text-decoration: none;
    font-size: {{ block.settings.nav_font_size }}px;
    font-family: {{ block.settings.nav_font_family.family }}, {{ block.settings.nav_font_family.fallback_families }};
    font-weight: {{ block.settings.nav_font_weight }};
    transition: color 0.3s ease;
  }

  .ai-footer-nav-{{ ai_gen_id }} a:hover {
    color: {{ block.settings.nav_hover_color }};
  }

  .ai-footer-social-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    gap: {{ block.settings.social_icon_spacing }}px;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .ai-footer-social-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: {{ block.settings.social_icon_size }}px;
    height: {{ block.settings.social_icon_size }}px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .ai-footer-social-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }} svg {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    fill: {{ block.settings.social_icon_color }};
    transition: fill 0.3s ease;
  }

  .ai-footer-social-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover svg {
    fill: {{ block.settings.nav_hover_color }};
  }

  .ai-footer-divider-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    height: 1px;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.divider_color }};
    margin-bottom: {{ block.settings.divider_bottom_margin }}px;
  }

  .ai-footer-columns-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
    gap: {{ block.settings.column_spacing }}px;
    align-items: start;
  }

  .ai-footer-column-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    text-align: {{ block.settings.text_alignment }};
  }

  .ai-footer-column-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    color: {{ block.settings.heading_color }};
    font-size: {{ block.settings.heading_font_size }}px;
    font-family: {{ block.settings.heading_font_family.family }}, {{ block.settings.heading_font_family.fallback_families }};
    font-weight: {{ block.settings.heading_font_weight }};
    text-transform: {{ block.settings.heading_text_transform }};
    margin: 0 0 {{ block.settings.heading_margin_bottom }}px 0;
  }

  .ai-footer-column-links-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
  }

  .ai-footer-column-links-{{ ai_gen_id }} li {
    margin-bottom: {{ block.settings.link_row_gap }}px;
  }

  .ai-footer-column-links-{{ ai_gen_id }} a {
    color: {{ block.settings.link_color }};
    text-decoration: none;
    font-size: {{ block.settings.link_font_size }}px;
    font-family: {{ block.settings.link_font_family.family }}, {{ block.settings.link_font_family.fallback_families }};
    font-weight: {{ block.settings.link_font_weight }};
    line-height: {{ block.settings.link_line_height }};
    transition: color 0.3s ease;
  }

  .ai-footer-column-links-{{ ai_gen_id }} a:hover {
    color: {{ block.settings.link_hover_color }};
  }

  .ai-footer-support-item-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 10px;
    margin-bottom: {{ block.settings.link_row_gap }}px;
    justify-content: {% if block.settings.text_alignment == 'center' %}center{% elsif block.settings.text_alignment == 'right' %}flex-end{% else %}flex-start{% endif %};
  }

  .ai-footer-support-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: {{ block.settings.support_icon_size }}px;
    height: {{ block.settings.support_icon_size }}px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    margin-top: 2px;
  }

  .ai-footer-support-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }} svg {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    stroke: {{ block.settings.support_icon_color }};
  }

  .ai-footer-support-text-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    color: {{ block.settings.link_color }};
    font-size: {{ block.settings.link_font_size }}px;
    font-family: {{ block.settings.link_font_family.family }}, {{ block.settings.link_font_family.fallback_families }};
    font-weight: {{ block.settings.link_font_weight }};
    line-height: {{ block.settings.link_line_height }};
  }

  .ai-footer-support-text-{{ ai_gen_id }} a {
    color: {{ block.settings.link_color }};
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: color 0.3s ease;
  }

  .ai-footer-support-text-{{ ai_gen_id }} a:hover {
    color: {{ block.settings.link_hover_color }};
  }

  .ai-footer-bottom-bar-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    background-color: {{ block.settings.bottom_bar_bg_color }};
    padding: {{ block.settings.bottom_bar_height }}px 0;
  }

  .ai-footer-bottom-container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    max-width: {{ block.settings.footer_max_width }}px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 {{ block.settings.side_margin }}px;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 20px;
  }

  .ai-footer-copyright-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    color: {{ block.settings.copyright_text_color }};
    font-size: {{ block.settings.copyright_font_size }}px;
    text-align: {{ block.settings.copyright_alignment }};
  }

  .ai-footer-payment-icons-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    gap: {{ block.settings.payment_icon_gap }}px;
    align-items: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .ai-footer-payment-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    height: {{ block.settings.payment_icon_height }}px;
    width: auto;
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 989px) {
    .ai-footer-columns-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
      gap: {{ block.settings.mobile_column_spacing }}px;
    }

    .ai-footer-top-row-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    .ai-footer-nav-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      gap: {{ block.settings.mobile_nav_gap }}px;
    }

    .ai-footer-main-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      padding: {{ block.settings.mobile_panel_padding_top }}px {{ block.settings.mobile_panel_padding_horizontal }}px {{ block.settings.mobile_panel_padding_bottom }}px;
    }

    .ai-footer-nav-{{ ai_gen_id }} a {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.mobile_nav_font_size }}px;
    }

    .ai-footer-social-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      width: {{ block.settings.mobile_social_icon_size }}px;
      height: {{ block.settings.mobile_social_icon_size }}px;
    }
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 749px) {
    .ai-footer-columns-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: {{ block.settings.mobile_column_spacing }}px;
    }

    .ai-footer-nav-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      width: 100%;
      display: {% if block.settings.mobile_hide_nav %}none{% else %}flex{% endif %};
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: {{ block.settings.mobile_nav_gap }}px;
    }

    .ai-footer-bottom-container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      flex-direction: column;
      text-align: center;
      gap: 15px;
    }

    .ai-footer-copyright-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      text-align: center;
    }

    .ai-footer-payment-icons-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      justify-content: center;
    }

    .ai-footer-column-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.mobile_heading_font_size }}px;
    }

    .ai-footer-column-links-{{ ai_gen_id }} a {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.mobile_link_font_size }}px;
    }

    .ai-footer-support-text-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.mobile_link_font_size }}px;
    }
  }
{% endstyle %}

<footer-custom-{{ ai_gen_id }} class="ai-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
  <div class="ai-footer-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
    <div class="ai-footer-main-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
      <div class="ai-footer-top-row-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        <nav class="ai-footer-nav-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          {% if block.settings.footer_menu != blank %}
            {% for link in block.settings.footer_menu.links %}
              <a href="{{ link.url }}">{{ link.title }}</a>
            {% endfor %}
          {% endif %}
        </nav>

        <div class="ai-footer-social-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          {% if block.settings.youtube_url != blank %}
            <a href="{{ block.settings.youtube_url }}" class="ai-footer-social-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }}" aria-label="YouTube" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                <path d="M23.498 6.186a3.016 3.016 0 0 0-2.122-2.136C19.505 3.545 12 3.545 12 3.545s-7.505 0-9.377.505A3.017 3.017 0 0 0 .502 6.186C0 8.07 0 12 0 12s0 3.93.502 5.814a3.016 3.016 0 0 0 2.122 2.136c1.871.505 9.376.505 9.376.505s7.505 0 9.377-.505a3.015 3.015 0 0 0 2.122-2.136C24 15.93 24 12 24 12s0-3.93-.502-5.814zM9.545 15.568V8.432L15.818 12l-6.273 3.568z"/>
              </svg>
            </a>
          {% endif %}

          {% if block.settings.facebook_url != blank %}
            <a href="{{ block.settings.facebook_url }}" class="ai-footer-social-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }}" aria-label="Facebook" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                <path d="M24 12.073c0-6.627-5.373-12-12-12s-12 5.373-12 12c0 5.99 4.388 10.954 10.125 11.854v-8.385H7.078v-3.47h3.047V9.43c0-3.007 1.792-4.669 4.533-4.669 1.312 0 2.686.235 2.686.235v2.953H15.83c-1.491 0-1.956.925-1.956 1.874v2.25h3.328l-.532 3.47h-2.796v8.385C19.612 23.027 24 18.062 24 12.073z"/>
              </svg>
            </a>
          {% endif %}

          {% if block.settings.instagram_url != blank %}
            <a href="{{ block.settings.instagram_url }}" class="ai-footer-social-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }}" aria-label="Instagram" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                <path d="M12 0C8.74 0 8.333.015 7.053.072 5.775.132 4.905.333 4.14.63c-.789.306-1.459.717-2.126 1.384S.935 3.35.63 4.14C.333 4.905.131 5.775.072 7.053.012 8.333 0 8.74 0 12s.015 3.667.072 4.947c.06 1.277.261 2.148.558 2.913.306.788.717 1.459 1.384 2.126.667.666 1.336 1.079 2.126 1.384.766.296 1.636.499 2.913.558C8.333 23.988 8.74 24 12 24s3.667-.015 4.947-.072c1.277-.06 2.148-.262 2.913-.558.788-.306 1.459-.718 2.126-1.384.666-.667 1.079-1.335 1.384-2.126.296-.765.499-1.636.558-2.913.06-1.28.072-1.687.072-4.947s-.015-3.667-.072-4.947c-.06-1.277-.262-2.149-.558-2.913-.306-.789-.718-1.459-1.384-2.126C21.319 1.347 20.651.935 19.86.63c-.765-.297-1.636-.499-2.913-.558C15.667.012 15.26 0 12 0zm0 2.16c3.203 0 3.585.016 4.85.071 1.17.055 1.805.249 2.227.415.562.217.96.477 1.382.896.419.42.679.819.896 1.381.164.422.36 1.057.413 2.227.057 1.266.07 1.646.07 4.85s-.015 3.585-.074 4.85c-.061 1.17-.256 1.805-.421 2.227-.224.562-.479.96-.899 1.382-.419.419-.824.679-1.38.896-.42.164-1.065.36-2.235.413-1.274.057-1.649.07-4.859.07-3.211 0-3.586-.015-4.859-.074-1.171-.061-1.816-.256-2.236-.421-.569-.224-.96-.479-1.379-.899-.421-.419-.69-.824-.9-1.38-.165-.42-.359-1.065-.42-2.235-.045-1.26-.061-1.649-.061-4.844 0-3.196.016-3.586.061-4.861.061-1.17.255-1.814.42-2.234.21-.57.479-.96.9-1.381.419-.419.81-.689 1.379-.898.42-.166 1.051-.361 2.221-.421 1.275-.045 1.65-.06 4.859-.06l.045.03zm0 3.678c-3.405 0-6.162 2.76-6.162 6.162 0 3.405 2.76 6.162 6.162 6.162 3.405 0 6.162-2.76 6.162-6.162 0-3.405-2.76-6.162-6.162-6.162zM12 16c-2.21 0-4-1.79-4-4s1.79-4 4-4 4 1.79 4 4-1.79 4-4 4zm7.846-10.405c0 .795-.646 1.44-1.44 1.44-.795 0-1.44-.646-1.44-1.44 0-.794.646-1.439 1.44-1.439.793-.001 1.44.645 1.44 1.439z"/>
              </svg>
            </a>
          {% endif %}
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="ai-footer-divider-{{ ai_gen_id }}"></div>

      <div class="ai-footer-columns-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        <div class="ai-footer-column-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          <h3 class="ai-footer-column-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.column_1_heading }}</h3>
          <div class="ai-footer-support-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            {% if block.settings.support_address != blank %}
              <div class="ai-footer-support-item-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                {% if block.settings.show_support_icons %}
                  <div class="ai-footer-support-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" stroke-width="2">
                      <path d="M21 10c0 7-9 13-9 13s-9-6-9-13a9 9 0 0 1 18 0z"></path>
                      <circle cx="12" cy="10" r="3"></circle>
                    </svg>
                  </div>
                {% endif %}
                <div class="ai-footer-support-text-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.support_address }}</div>
              </div>
            {% endif %}

            {% if block.settings.support_email != blank %}
              <div class="ai-footer-support-item-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                {% if block.settings.show_support_icons %}
                  <div class="ai-footer-support-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" stroke-width="2">
                      <path d="M4 4h16c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2v12c0 1.1-.9 2-2 2H4c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V6c0-1.1.9-2 2-2z"></path>
                      <polyline points="22,6 12,13 2,6"></polyline>
                    </svg>
                  </div>
                {% endif %}
                <div class="ai-footer-support-text-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                  <a href="mailto:{{ block.settings.support_email }}">{{ block.settings.support_email }}</a>
                </div>
              </div>
            {% endif %}

            {% if block.settings.support_phone != blank %}
              <div class="ai-footer-support-item-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                {% if block.settings.show_support_icons %}
                  <div class="ai-footer-support-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" stroke-width="2">
                      <path d="M22 16.92v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.18 2 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-8.63-3.07 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-3.07-8.67A2 2 0 0 1 4.11 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.72 12.84 12.84 0 0 0 .7 2.81 2 2 0 0 1-.45 2.11L8.09 9.91a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.27-1.27a2 2 0 0 1 2.11-.45 12.84 12.84 0 0 0 2.81.7A2 2 0 0 1 22 16.92z"></path>
                    </svg>
                  </div>
                {% endif %}
                <div class="ai-footer-support-text-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                  <a href="tel:{{ block.settings.support_phone }}">{{ block.settings.support_phone }}</a>
                </div>
              </div>
            {% endif %}
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="ai-footer-column-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          <h3 class="ai-footer-column-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.column_2_heading }}</h3>
          <ul class="ai-footer-column-links-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            {% if block.settings.column_2_menu != blank %}
              {% for link in block.settings.column_2_menu.links %}
                <li><a href="{{ link.url }}">{{ link.title }}</a></li>
              {% endfor %}
            {% endif %}
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="ai-footer-column-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          <h3 class="ai-footer-column-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.column_3_heading }}</h3>
          <ul class="ai-footer-column-links-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            {% if block.settings.column_3_menu != blank %}
              {% for link in block.settings.column_3_menu.links %}
                <li><a href="{{ link.url }}">{{ link.title }}</a></li>
              {% endfor %}
            {% endif %}
          </ul>
        </div>

